This repository is the source of a personal portfolio at bmath8.vercel.app.

The original work here — the page design, layout, copy, imagery, procedural
shading and animation code, and the project write-ups — is not licensed for
reuse or redistribution. You may read it, and you are welcome to learn from it.
You may not republish it, in whole or in substantial part, as your own site.

This is deliberate rather than an oversight. A portfolio is an identity
document: its value depends on it belonging to one person. Permissive terms
would invite exactly the wholesale copying that would undermine it. If you want
to use something here, ask.

